erview.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2152500/extras/ff969533ce6a23bb730747a001292447.poster.avif?t=1787221000\" width=900 height=506 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2152500/extras/ff969533ce6a23bb730747a001292447.webm?t=1787221000\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2152500/extras/ff969533ce6a23bb730747a001292447.mp4?t=1787221000\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Human-Centric – <i>Manage Troops, Dispatch Runners, Tend to Needs</i></strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every soldier under your command has a name, a life before the war, and unique traits. Keep morale high, tend to their needs, and weigh the human costs of every decision.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Officers bring unique strengths and flaws based on their backgrounds – from aristocrats raised in privilege to battle-hardened survivors from the ranks.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Runners are the lifeline of your command. Every order takes time to deliver, and miscommunication can spell disaster. Need to cancel that attack? Hope the runner makes it in time.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2152500/extras/a918a11d2da0f5e6d233d479d020fdf5.poster.avif?t=1787221000\" width=900 height=506 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2152500/extras/a918a11d2da0f5e6d233d479d020fdf5.webm?t=1787221000\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2152500/extras/a918a11d2da0f5e6d233d479d020fdf5.mp4?t=1787221000\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>The Trenches are Alive</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Dynamic Timing</strong>: Time is a weapon. Orders take time to arrive, and changing plans requires swift runners and careful planning.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Sweat Saves Blood</strong>: Expand your trench network, set routes for your men to move where they are least exposed to enemy fire, and shore up your defenses before the enemy flanks you.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Poor Bloody Infantry</strong>: Balance the need for butter and bullets. Keep your men fed, rested and armed – or watch the fighting spirit of your platoon collapse.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>True to History</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Immerse yourself in the grim reality of WW1. D<i>ig In </i>honors the human cost of war while delivering an engaging strategy experience.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Will you triumph against all odds or crumble under the weight of trench warfare? The choice is yours.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Wishlist now and prepare to Dig In!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2152500/extras/83c0880de52ac5b0f9f3797f910851b3.poster.avif?t=1787221000\" width=900 height=506 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2152500/extras/83c0880de52ac5b0f9f3797f910851b3.webm?t=1787221000\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2152500/extras/83c0880de52ac5b0f9f3797f910851b3.mp4?t=1787221000\" type=\"video/mp4\"></v